{"id":"tretij","lemma":"третий","pos":"adj","rank":860,"glosses":["third"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мне это купил мой третий муж.","en":"My third husband bought me this.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase","l":"купить"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"husband"}]},{"text":"Том - третий муж моей дочери.","en":"Tom is my daughter's third husband.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"husband"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"daughter","l":"дочь"}]},{"text":"Я хочу третий вариант.","en":"I want a third alternative.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"version"}]},{"text":"А какой третий вариант?","en":"What's the third choice?","words":[{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"what, what one"},null,{"g":"version"}]},{"text":"Это уже в третий раз происходит.","en":"That's the third time this has happened.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"time"},{"g":"to take place","l":"происходить"}]}]}